# Mailwoman — notices for addresses the app does not know (source locale: en).
# t32-h10. Ids are `errors-*`. The server's own error page (a path the server does
# not serve) is server-rendered English until server.ftl lands (t32-ext.md §15, L5).

# Shown as a notice after an unknown mail address (`#/bogus`) was replaced by the inbox.
errors-mail-route-not-found = That page does not exist. Showing your inbox.
# Shown on the admin dashboard after an unknown section (`/admin#/bogus`), or one the
# admin's role does not include, was replaced by the dashboard.
errors-admin-section-not-found = That section does not exist, or your role does not include it. Showing the dashboard.
